<title>GREECE: CAPITAL MKT COMSN OKS GALIS IPO, MYTILINEOS OFFERING.</title>
<headline>CAPITAL MKT COMSN OKS GALIS IPO, MYTILINEOS OFFERING.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece's capital market commission cleared the initial public offering of Nick Galis Youth Centres SA and the public offering of metals trading firm Mytilineos.</p>
<p>The company of former basketball star Galis will go public with an issue of 660,000 registered ordinary shares for listing on the bourse's small-cap parallel market.</p>
<p>After its offering, Mytilineos will transfer to the bourse's main market.</p>
<p>The commission also approved the licence of investment company BVC SA, it said. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
